# COM-LOG-01: Audit log

## Purpose
Records who did what to which data, so a change of a restricted class can be traced. Every unit that creates, changes or deletes such data calls it.

## Interface

| Operation | Inputs | Result |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `audit.record` | actor, action, entity, entity id, before, after | an audit record id |

## Rules of use
- Call it in the same transaction as the change, so the record exists exactly when the change does.
- Never put a value of class `restricted` in `before` or `after`; record that it changed.
- Never call it for reads of public data.
